    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;60fps mode comming!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children disappeared, adults turned into carrion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A certain isolated island that turned into hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &quot;relics&quot; sleeping on the island and acquire skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on mysteries and powerful enemies using a variety of actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy 2D action game by Magus, the girl in black.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and rich 2D action all drawn with pixelart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the action of the player charactor \u201dMagus\u201d with classic and easy-to-understand controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive the attacking opponent and use it as a trigger for jumping through walls, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just defeat the enemy, use a variety of skills to move forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dramatic truth surrounding the girls Mags, where guilt, anger, and sadness intertwine.</p>",
